---
.title = "iroh: encrypted peer-to-peer",
.description = "iroh carries CapTP over encrypted QUIC with discovery and NAT traversal, and names each peer by a self-authenticating key rather than a host and port.",
.date = @date("2026-06-17T00:00:00"),
.author = "Jim Isaacs",
